ublished":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n4","cat":"Business","title":"Dow rises 0.69% to about 52,856 as tech stocks rally","summary":"The S&P 500 gained 0.59% to about 7,757 and the Nasdaq rose 1.05% to about 26,702 on Wednesday. SpaceX shares jumped nearly 8% after earnings beat expectations.","source":"Investrade","url":"https://investrade.com/market-review-october-21-2026/","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n5","cat":"World","title":"U.S. orders some diplomats out of Saudi Arabia amid Houthi attacks","summary":"The State Department ordered non-emergency staff and families to leave Saudi Arabia after Houthi strikes on airports and infrastructure. Debris from an intercepted drone killed two people at the Shaybah oil field.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12112168/saudi-arabia-us-diplomat-evacuations-houthi-attacks/","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n6","cat":"Business","title":"Meta revenue up 26% to $64.6B; capex guidance raised","summary":"Meta's Q3 revenue reached $64.6 billion and it raised the low end of 2026 capital spending guidance to $135-145 billion. Free cash flow turned negative for the first time since 2012 on AI spending.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/meta-shares-jump-5-as-ai-investments-fuel-revenue-growth","published":"2026-10-22"},{"id":"n7","cat":"World","title":"Zelenskyy backs freezing front line as first step to ceasefire","summary":"Zelenskyy said halting fighting along current lines is the most realistic path to ending the war, with security guarantees from partners. He also said Starlink and Starshield service to Ukraine remains limited.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/21/zelenskyy-backs-freezing-front-line-as-first-step-towards-ukraine-ceasefire","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n8","cat":"Canada","title":"Ottawa takes some federal websites offline over PHP flaw","summary":"AI Minister Evan Solomon said sites are being pulled temporarily on Canadian Centre for Cyber Security advice while patches are applied. PHP underpins roughly 70% of websites.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12110881/government-sites-go-dark-vuln-in-code/","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n9","cat":"Business","title":"Tesla Q3 profit falls 43% as SpaceX merger talks advance","summary":"Tesla earned $787 million on about $28 billion in revenue and cut its 2026 capex forecast to about $20 billion. Tesla and SpaceX have formed committees to explore a possible merger.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/teslas-profit-drops-as-it-explores-a-possible-merger-with-musks-other-public-company-space","published":"2026-10-22"},{"id":"n10","cat":"World","title":"Vatican: Pope Leo's lung tumour was cancer but needs no more treatment","summary":"Tests confirmed a localised pulmonary adenocarcinoma that had not spread, and doctors said no further therapy is needed. The Pope had surgery on his right lung on Oct. 13.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/21/pope-leo-xiv-post-op-results-show-no-further-treatment-required-as-tumour-was-localised","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n11","cat":"Canada","title":"Carney won't rule out Quebec-style immigration deal for Alberta","summary":"After about 53% of Albertans backed more provincial control over immigration, Carney said \"we'll see\" but that overall levels won't change. Premier Smith is preparing a proposal.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12112197/mark-carney-alberta-immigration-deal-quebec/","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n12","cat":"AI","title":"Meta's Muse AI app passes 10 million users","summary":"Meta said about 25% of Muse users use it daily and shopping is a top activity. Zuckerberg expects compute costs per user to fall more than 10x within a year.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/21/meta-says-muse-has-over-10m-users-with-shopping-a-top-activity/","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n13","cat":"Business","title":"Barclays to cut about 5,000 jobs as it leans on AI","summary":"The bank plans to cut roughly 5% of its workforce by end-2026, targeting over GBP 1.1 billion in savings. Q3 net profit rose 13% and it announced a GBP 500 million buyback.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/barclays-to-cut-5000-jobs-as-it-turns-to-ai-to-improve-efficiency","published":"2026-10-22"},{"id":"n14","cat":"Major","title":"Micron workers stage Taiwan's first chip-industry strike","summary":"Union workers at Micron's Taoyuan plant walked out on Oct. 22 in a dispute over bonuses and sharing of AI-driven memory-chip profits.","source":"Nikkei Asia","url":"https://asia.nikkei.com/business/tech/semiconductors/taiwan-s-first-ever-chip-workers-strike-begins-at-micron-plant","published":"2026-10-22"},{"id":"n15","cat":"Canada","title":"PSAC sets strike votes for 120,000 federal workers","summary":"Voting runs Nov. 16 to Jan. 22 after about 18 months of talks; the union says wages, job security, remote work and AI protections are unresolved.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12112316/psac-strike-votes-november/","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n16","cat":"World","title":"El Salvador launches operation to free technicians kidnapped in Haiti","summary":"President Bukele announced a military operation to rescue four Salvadoran aviation technicians abducted by gangs near Port-au-Prince on Sunday, the first major attack on the international gang suppression force.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/el-salvador-launches-military-operation-in-haiti-to-free-four-kidnapped-aviation-technicia","published":"2026-10-22"},{"id":"n17","cat":"AI","title":"AI-assisted research proves 31-year-old KLS math conjecture","summary":"Microsoft Research's Xinzhi Zhang and Zhao Song proved the 1995 Kannan-Lovasz-Simonovits conjecture using a human-directed process with multiple AI agents exploring about 100 research paths.","source":"Unite.AI","url":"https://www.unite.ai/microsoft-researcher-and-collaborator-prove-31-year-old-kls-conjecture/","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n18","cat":"AI","title":"AI lab Flapping Airplanes raises $1B at $6B valuation","summary":"The San Francisco lab, focused on training AI with less data and compute, raised the round led by Index Ventures and Lux Capital. Its valuation has quadrupled since January.","source":"The Next Web","url":"https://thenextweb.com/news/flapping-airplanes-1b-6b-valuation","published":"2026-10-21"},{"id":"n19","cat":"Major","title":"France confirms first human case of cattle-borne Shamonda virus","summary":"An immunocompromised patient in Lyon who died in early October was infected, likely by a midge bite. Authorities say no risk to the general public has been identified.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/france-confirms-first-human-case-of-shamonda-virus-previously-found-only-in-animals","published":"2026-10-22"}]}